message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "poker-gto-assistant"
abstract: >-
  Game Theory Optimal advisor for home Texas Hold'em games. Streamlit
  Python engine plus two standalone browser-based front-ends. Monte
  Carlo equity, preflop RFI charts, and a TexasSolver wrapper for
  postflop GTO calculations.
